    <p class="lede">We turn science, real and imagined, into work people meet in the open: records, films, books and programs. Every project is scoped and costed before it reaches you. Led by an evolutionary ecologist (PhD, ANU), AAAS Dance Your PhD Overall Winner 2024. We carry the grant application.</p>
    <p class="deal">You fund work that would not otherwise exist. We make it and own it, and you get the credit, the reach and the acquittal reporting.</p>
